  "id": "municipality",
  "title": "LGA boundaries (municipalities)",
  "description": "LGA boundaries (municipalities): LIST product `MUNICIPALITY`, statewide. 29 features, multi-polygon (EPSG:28355). Built from the 29 per-LGA LIST zips: features LIST clipped at LGA boundaries are rejoined to one row per `LIST_GUID`, and an `lga` column names the source LGA(s); parts outside every LGA (over open water) are not in any LGA file. Source released 2021-01-13. Data (c) State of Tasmania, CC BY 3.0 AU: cite as \"LGA boundaries (municipalities)\" from theLIST (c) State of Tasmania.",
